  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "VIDEO_DECOMPRESSED",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTubelet Dataset\n\t\n\nPre-extracted raw video tubelets from the Egocentric-10K dataset\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTensor Format\n\t\n\nEach  file is a single tubelet saved with  and can be loaded with .\n\n\t\n\t\t\nProperty\nValue\n\n\n\t\t\nShape\n\n\n\nDtype\n\n\n\nLayout\n\u2014 Frames \u00d7 Height \u00d7 Width \u00d7 Channels\n\n\nFrames\n64 raw RGB frames per tubelet\n\n\nResolution\n384 \u00d7 384 center-cropped\n\n\nPixel Range\n0\u2013255 (unnormalized)\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t1. Frame Rate Downsampling\n\t\n\n\nSource videos are downsampled to 4 FPS using FFmpeg's\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/rookierufus/VIDEO_DECOMPRESSED.",
